    <briefdescription>
<para>Simple class to collect nodes in the Sage III IR. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The template type T should be a child class of SgLocatedNode.</para><para>Create a node collector, initializing it to identify nodes that of type T whose physical line numbers lie between a specified interval (b, e) inclusive. Call &apos;traverse&apos; on a particular root node to initiate the search. On return, use beginMatch/endMatch to iterate over matching nodes. </para>    </detaileddescription>
